  "editorial_article": "Camomile Dawn is an Istanbul-based electronic artist whose work explores lo-fi house and techno textures. Operating as a project of the artist also known as Sumatran Black, the producer maintains a presence on Bandcamp where EPs such as The Ghosts of Seoul/London were released. The music is characterized by bedroom-produced house rhythms and synthesized atmospheres. His output has garnered attention from digital music platforms, including features on Bandcamp's monthly electronic music roundups.",
